WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.555
Tom and Cat came out of the Dark Forest.

2
00:00:05.556 --> 00:00:18.694
They were on their way to the palace.

3
00:00:18.695 --> 00:00:23.066
"Why are you going to the palace?" Cat asked.

4
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:28.822
"I want to be the royal wizard," Tom said.

5
00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:34.387
"But I'm not very good at magic."

6
00:00:34.388 --> 00:00:58.277
"You have a kind heart," Cat said.

7
00:00:58.278 --> 00:01:01.036
Soon Tom saw the palace.

8
00:01:01.037 --> 00:01:03.948
"Wow!" he said.

9
00:01:03.949 --> 00:01:07.086
The palace had tall white towers.

10
00:01:07.087 --> 00:01:13.944
There was a wide moat and a drawbridge.

11
00:01:13.945 --> 00:01:17.409
Two guards stood near the gates.

12
00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.172
"Hurry up!" said one guard.

13
00:01:20.173 --> 00:01:27.731
"The tryouts start soon!"

14
00:01:27.732 --> 00:01:31.852
Tom ran into the Grand Hall.

15
00:01:31.853 --> 00:01:39.215
Some wizards were gathered around a tall man.

16
00:01:39.216 --> 00:01:42.590
"My name is Dirk!" the man snapped.

17
00:01:42.591 --> 00:01:46.494
"I'm the head servant here!"

18
00:01:46.495 --> 00:02:01.377
"Dirk looks mean," Tom thought.

19
00:02:01.378 --> 00:02:06.325
"All wizards in the Throne Room!" Dirk ordered.

20
00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:09.023
"Right now!"

21
00:02:09.024 --> 00:02:14.542
"Yes, Dirk!" said all the wizards.

22
00:02:14.543 --> 00:02:17.395
Dirk stomped away.

23
00:02:17.396 --> 00:02:21.840
Tom ran after him. "Excuse me?"

24
00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.593
Dirk spun around.

25
00:02:24.594 --> 00:02:27.226
"What do you want?"

26
00:02:27.227 --> 00:02:33.106
"What's going on in the Throne Room?" Tom asked.

27
00:02:33.107 --> 00:02:36.775
"The tryouts, you fool!" Dirk said.

28
00:02:36.776 --> 00:02:40.556
He grinned and leaned in closer to Tom.

29
00:02:40.557 --> 00:02:43.269
"You'll never get the job.

30
00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:51.807
My daughter will be the next royal wizard!"

31
00:02:51.808 --> 00:02:53.984
Dirk hurried off.

32
00:02:53.985 --> 00:03:00.170
Tom sighed. "It's hopeless, Cat."

33
00:03:00.171 --> 00:03:05.690
Cat licked her paws.

34
00:03:05.691 --> 00:03:13.967
"Perhaps not," she said.

